    "f-heading-1721380050eTZMy-text_html": "identity",
    "f-richtext-17213800503Tlr3-text_html": "Our identity is a statement that can accommodate different layouts. While the Line Statement is the preferred identifier, the Flex Statement is equally significant.",
    "f-richtext-1721380050EnoWu-text_html": "DO NOT BREAK FORM: when adapting to layout scenarios, ensure the statement is in its intended format.",
    "f-heading-17213800509zJW0-text_html": "do not",
    "f-richtext-1721380050z3qaD-text_html": "Plain and simple. No effects. And – depending on the background – keep it minimal. Our logo is a statement that represent the brand.",
    "f-richtext-1721380050mG62L-text_html": "Conditions apply to all logo variants:",
    "f-richtext-1721380050hJQNk-text_html": "line statment",
